Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: corium
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: static initramfs initializer for Carapace roots
 Corium discovers and mounts a read-only Carapace root filesystem, then
 executes /sbin/init. Image builders install the static executable as
 /init in their initramfs.
